# WHITELIST, not blacklist.
#
# Listing binary names here failed twice: build products share their stem with the source
# (so `check_all` cannot be matched by a pattern that spares `check_all.cu`), and every new
# probe invented a name nobody remembered to add. Nine binaries reached the repo that way.
#
# So: ignore everything, then re-admit only the file types that belong in it.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!Makefile
!*.cu
!*.h
!*.md

# ...then re-exclude the throwaway probe sources, which are also *.cu. These are the
# one-off experiments from the investigations, not part of the test suite.
*_tmp.cu

# Shadowed third-party headers used for intervention experiments (report section 12).
# The real CUTLASS checkout at $(CUTLASS) is never modified.
cutlass_patch/
